{"data": {"job": {"id": 2827291, "title": null, "experience_from": 2.0, "experience_to": null, "description": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Assistant\nManager </b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are looking for\nan experienced, ambitious, and inspiring Assistant Manager to join our team. You\nneed to have an open, engaging and humble personality, with confidence\nto be the face of Brindisa Kitchens. You will have a good\nunderstanding of operations and finance, with a passion for delivering\noutstanding customer experiences. Ideally, you’ll be an Assistant General\nManager or Assistant Manager in casual or high-end restaurants.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Be part of our team</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here at Brindisa, our food is homely and authentic, with flavour always being the key factor.\nAbove all our food is about sharing. We celebrate the culture and dining\nexperience of small plates. We have a direct relationship with all our\nsuppliers, bringing their ethos and quality to the table.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>We offer:</b></p><ul>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">28\n     days holiday</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Paid\n     overtime</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">35%\n     discounts in our restaurants and our retail offerings</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Cycle\n     to work scheme</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Refer a friend reward</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Opportunity\n     to progress within the business across our sites</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Opportunity\n     for trips to Spain to meet our producers </li></ul></div>", "private_description": null, "estimated_start_date": null, "job_application_type": "CUSTOM", "deleted": false, "access_mode": "BOTH", "post_type": "BOTH", "duration_mode": "ONE_TIME", "type_code": "PUBLISHED", "template_id": 1145320, "start_date": "Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:40:06 GMT", "alias_position": "Assistant Manager", "language": null, "request_video_cover_letter": false, "third_party_tracking": null, "ats_email_templat